{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_03cf0b6bfc8b07e8a53c4f9ccf4e8a33e83dddeea11ff2432251ea8f7e55a04c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: conventions require TDD-first, WHY-only comments, no magic numbers, no unwrap() outside tests, and no ratatui/crossterm dependencies in pixtuoid-core or pixtuoid-scene."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2d0b20251ade98d5610c27842f56fd5668f5c06f92510d97ccceb32a35a99ebf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors use `just build`, `just test` (nextest), and `just preflight` as the pre-push gate running lint, clippy, hack, and test in CI order."},{"claim_ids":["clm_60d20b25f9a9f84e0723590a99a9b1fa48c0a1b33843d876f8d1edf55368d1a8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is a Rust workspace of five crates, with the core having no terminal dependencies."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7182be8fb87e29d4635428e9d7ac5b36deab44741467ab29a05829c4a0d6d353"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: committed repo skills include two-lens-review, beautify-decoration, add-source, add-theme, and procedural-lofi."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9f7329ff90d50b620236a161562118674fb09717c57bfc51f908024416363ea3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: non-trivial work follows an arc (pick, design gate, spec, TDD build, self-review, merge gate) where the merge gate is a two-lens-review skill requiring 2+ differentiated lenses, green CI, and dispositioned bot findings, and a human performs the merge."}],"claim_ids":["clm_03cf0b6bfc8b07e8a53c4f9ccf4e8a33e83dddeea11ff2432251ea8f7e55a04c","clm_2d0b20251ade98d5610c27842f56fd5668f5c06f92510d97ccceb32a35a99ebf","clm_60d20b25f9a9f84e0723590a99a9b1fa48c0a1b33843d876f8d1edf55368d1a8","clm_7182be8fb87e29d4635428e9d7ac5b36deab44741467ab29a05829c4a0d6d353","clm_9f7329ff90d50b620236a161562118674fb09717c57bfc51f908024416363ea3"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_2aa4b184da83407ea5d9ffade9c901fb","id":"pg_06ca94bca79a52eab737de3ca17bc72d","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/ivanwng97-pixtuoid-claude-md-61fa3012895f-de3ca17bc72d.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_08e915910d165cf3839610e565094b84"],"title":"IvanWng97/pixtuoid/CLAUDE.md @ 61fa3012895f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2aa4b184da83407ea5d9ffade9c901fb"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1ccfd0076f73d0bb71465a20caafa5558b3a55e827a97e9d82f4ef8eae063fca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Pressing s opens a Sources panel to connect an agent CLI without a separate install step; disconnecting there removes the character, and broken hooks are flagged, with `pixtuoid doctor` providing a health report."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3529ea2f0de70e51c51306f82ff22ae3d9e367fbc254f32e6494d984b3bd79fd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The dependency set is audited for advisories daily using cargo-deny."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3ed4198bbe8af27dc97a01940e85a1ec3b8f355b306502a7bdbcb3b939de538f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The hook shim is designed to never block the agent: it performs a 200ms fire-and-forget write and can be invoked without blocking the agent CLI."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4029304457e35d873077cee9d7b3b0c20cd5d6365de7bf49abb8e629db8c9be5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"pixtuoid is a terminal-based tool that visualizes AI coding agents as pixel-art coworkers in an office, with each session shown as a character at a desk."},{"claim_ids":["clm_421884eda0507e4ffbdb07f809454b1c3241d527ffa6c45be2292f0bb5541773"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Pressing t opens a live-preview theme picker across six built-in palettes, and the chosen theme persists across sessions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_60d20b25f9a9f84e0723590a99a9b1fa48c0a1b33843d876f8d1edf55368d1a8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is a Rust workspace of five crates, with the core having no terminal dependencies."},{"claim_ids":["clm_73adba42ac7dec4170d0e27e2bb947fa157d45106e04aca6ad49c0063679c632"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The TUI exposes keyboard shortcuts: q quit, p pause, s sources panel, t themes, m sound, Tab agent dashboard, ? help, and arrow/jk/PgUp/PgDn floor navigation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7e1ec0c2c41fb7bfad252edf12129df250a049707e15c1a8fd5e138cf653529b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Windows support for Claude Code and Codex CLI is marked experimental, with limited testing and unsigned binaries."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ad870fd66fc869a3aeec03b38542a82af72cfbd410ddc93cb28b13c564551351"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent events arrive via two transports — a hook shim writing to a Unix socket (named pipe on Windows) with a 200ms fire-and-forget bound, and JSONL transcript watching — feeding one channel whose reducer folds events into office state for a half-block pixel-art renderer."},{"claim_ids":["clm_af4ed06a3d0ecf5abe3a988961ef50816d7d778e21950f6db4d8d49511e12dd9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Character shirt and pants colors derive from the working directory so same-repo agents share colors; hair and skin vary per agent across 16 curated outfits."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ca5564e2ed5d0a27d625c7d9726fb64a35e4fd52cc9702699d0ed8a394706617"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Configuration lives in ~/.config/pixtuoid/config.toml, created on first launch with all keys optional; CLI flags such as `pixtuoid run --theme dracula` override the file."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cf163466062182349dd9c2a91d342fb232b6f74e2d9b1ea686aac1f06a5cd485"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Each desk's monitor glows with the color of the tool currently in use (e.g. Edit blue)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d5d0df3977ea968e85ff9aa055b1d7d16240dd89ddfbe0cf82b4e9dd01b5cdc9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool is described as local-only and telemetry-free: it makes no network connections, ships no analytics, and reads agent transcripts read-only."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1ccfd0076f73d0bb71465a20caafa5558b3a55e827a97e9d82f4ef8eae063fca","clm_3529ea2f0de70e51c51306f82ff22ae3d9e367fbc254f32e6494d984b3bd79fd","clm_3ed4198bbe8af27dc97a01940e85a1ec3b8f355b306502a7bdbcb3b939de538f","clm_4029304457e35d873077cee9d7b3b0c20cd5d6365de7bf49abb8e629db8c9be5","clm_421884eda0507e4ffbdb07f809454b1c3241d527ffa6c45be2292f0bb5541773","clm_60d20b25f9a9f84e0723590a99a9b1fa48c0a1b33843d876f8d1edf55368d1a8","clm_73adba42ac7dec4170d0e27e2bb947fa157d45106e